# Rent Collection Module

## Payment Methods

Support:

- Mobile Money with local operator integration, wallets, USSD fallback, and mobile payment link generation
- Bank Transfer with local and international banking rails, SWIFT/SEPA support, and ACH/RTGS settlement
- Wallet payment using tenant, owner, vendor, and platform wallets with ledger reconciliation
- Debit Card and Credit Card processing with PCI-compliant tokenization, saved payment methods, and 3D Secure support
- Cash payments with receipt capture, deposit tracking, and manual reconciliation tools
- Cheque processing with deposit scheduling, clearing status, and bounce handling workflows
- POS terminals and card present payments, with integration to portable POS devices and merchant settlement reporting
- QR Code payments for scanning-based mobile payments, voucher payments, and instant wallet top-ups
- Direct debit and ACH authorization for recurring rent and service charge collections
- Biometric payment authorization for mobile app and kiosk collections where supported
- Payment gateway abstraction with provider failover and dynamic routing
- Multi-currency acceptance with conversion rules, currency selection, and currency revaluation
- Split payments across methods, partial settlement, and installment collection
- Preauthorized payments and payment mandates for automated recurring collections
- Fee management for payment method surcharges, transaction fees, and merchant costs
- Payment channel reporting for usage, success rates, and channel-specific reconciliation

## Payment Transactions

Features:

- Invoice generation with lease, unit, service charge, utility, and ad hoc charge support
- Payment receipts issuance with transaction references, receipt statuses, and printable/downloadable formats
- Payment reconciliation across payment methods, bank settlements, mobile money, card capture, and wallet transactions
- Overpayments, credits, refunds, and write-off handling with audit trail and customer statement updates
- Advance rent management, deposit application, prepayment allocation, and refund scheduling
- Late fee calculation based on configurable fee rules, grace periods, penalty schedules, and escalations
- Payment posting to accounting ledgers with journal entries, GL mapping, tax treatment, and currency translation
- Partial payment support, invoice splitting, and payment application rules for complex settlement scenarios
- Auto-match payments to open invoices using reference codes, amounts, and tenant account mappings
- Payment hold, dispute, and settlement workflows for compliance, chargebacks, and tenant claims
- Recurring invoice generation, automatic payment authorization, and auto-billing support for recurring rent and service fees
- Payment notifications, receipt notifications, and tenant reminders for upcoming or missed payments
- Payment reversals, correction entries, and multi-step approval for sensitive financial adjustments
- Integration with external payment gateways, banks, and reconciliation systems for real-time posting and settlement updates
- Multi-currency transaction handling, exchange rate management, and foreign currency revaluation for invoices and receipts
- Audit-ready payment history, transaction metadata, and user action logs for every payment event

## Arrears and Collections

Support:

- Aging reports by tenant, unit, property, portfolio, invoice type, and overdue period
- Dunning notices with configurable stage-based messaging, escalation rules, and channel delivery options
- Reminder schedules for email, SMS, push, USSD, and portal notifications based on due dates and arrears thresholds
- Collection workflows with collection stage management, responsible agents, task assignments, and audit trails
- Bad debt tracking, provisioning, recovery forecasting, and write-off approvals
- Collection scorecards, delinquency heatmaps, and recovery performance analytics
- Tenant account statements, arrears summaries, and consolidated balance reports
- Automated arrears classification, hold/restrict actions, and service disconnection workflows for non-payment
- Dispute handling with dispute tickets, notes, investigation status, and resolution history
- Legal escalation tracking with notice generation, eviction workflow handoff, and case management support
- Payment plan negotiation support with installment schedules, partial payment agreements, and conditional waivers
- Collection risk scoring and tenant credit impact indicators for portfolio risk management
- Integration with CRM, debt collection partners, and recovery agencies for outsourced collections
- Compliance with local debt collection regulations, fair practice notices, and consumer protection requirements
- Manager dashboards for overdue balances, aging buckets, recoveries, and cash flow impact
- Multi-tenant access controls for collections teams, property managers, and finance staff
- Audit trail for every collection activity, notice sent, and payment promise tracking

