# Wallet & Finance Module

## Wallet System

Support:

- Tenant wallet balances with ledger-backed transaction histories
- Landlord, property owner, and management company wallets
- Platform commissions, fees, and automated revenue share allocations
- In-app transfers between tenant, owner, vendor, and platform wallets
- Wallet top-ups, withdrawals, and deposit handling
- Wallet reconciliation with payment gateway settlements and bank statements
- Hold, reserve, and release funds for security deposits, pending invoices, pre-authorizations, and escrow
- Multi-currency balances with exchange rate conversion and currency revaluation
- Wallet usage rules, spend limits, and wallet credit allowances per tenant or lease
- Expiry, refund, and payout scheduling for wallet credits and retention reserves
- Wallet notifications for balance changes, low balance alerts, and transaction confirmations
- API access for wallet management, transaction posting, balance inquiry, and reconciliation
- Audit trails for every wallet transaction, hold adjustment, release, and refund event
- Support for tenant prepaid plans, recharge bundles, and loyalty/discount credits
- Integration with payment processors, mobile money wallets, and banking rails

## Expense Management

Support:

- Expense recording with full GL coding, tax treatment, and project/property tagging
- Expense categories, cost centers, and customizable expense types
- Vendor invoice capture, supplier bill entry, and receipt attachment
- Approval workflows with multi-level review, delegated approvers, and threshold-based escalation
- Reimbursements, employee expense claims, petty cash, and contractor payouts
- Cost allocation by property, building, unit, lease, department, or business unit
- Recurring expense scheduling, amortization, and budgeted cost matching
- Purchase order support, GRN matching, and invoice validation with three-way matching
- Expense splitting across multiple properties, units, or cost centers
- Expense policy enforcement with spend limits, category restrictions, and approval gatekeeping
- Budget tracking, variance analysis, and commitment accounting to compare planned vs actual spend
- Vendor spend dashboards, trending analysis, and supplier cost benchmarking
- Tax computed expense lines for VAT, GST, withholding tax, and local regulatory surcharges
- Expense adjustment, correction, credit note handling, and write-off workflows
- Integration with leasing, maintenance, service charge, and utility bills for full expense visibility
- Auditable expense history, attachment management, and change log tracking
- Multi-entity and multi-currency expense support for portfolio finance teams
- Expense import/export for bulk data entry, ERP connectivity, and accounting migration
- Payment scheduling, settlement tracking, and payment reconciliation for expense invoices

