# Utility Billing Module

Support:

- Meter reading capture for electricity, water, gas, waste, sewage, solar, cooling, heating, and other utility types
- Multi-source reading import with manual entry, mobile field capture, IoT/AMR integration, third-party metering feeds, and batch upload support
- Meter lifecycle management with meter assignment, calibration history, replacement tracking, and meter reading validation
- Utility tariff configuration supporting fixed, tiered, slab, time-of-use, seasonal, demand, consumption, flat-rate, and hybrid pricing models
- Tariff versioning, effective date management, rate overrides, concession rates, and usage thresholds
- Consumption-based billing with auto-calculation, aggregated consumption, prorated billing, historical usage baselines, and predictive consumption forecasts
- Shared utilities allocation by unit, tenant, building, block, floor, common area, occupancy ratio, floor area, or custom allocation formula
- Split billing for submetered and pooled utilities, common-area utilities, HOA/shared services, and special event/temporary usage
- Utility invoices with detailed consumption breakdowns, tariff line items, service charges, surcharges, taxes, subsidies, penalties, and custom charge codes
- Payment tracking for utility invoices, partial payments, overpayments, credits, deposits, payment adjustments, and write-offs
- Billing cycles and schedules for monthly, quarterly, seasonal, bi-monthly, weekly, and annual billing periods
- Automated bill generation, scheduled invoice publishing, bill reminders, recurring billing and auto-renewal for recurring services
- Utility account profiling with utility account numbers, meter serials, service addresses, provider accounts, and tenant responsibility mapping
- Notice and reminder workflows for bill due dates, late payment warnings, service disconnection notices, and payment confirmation
- Utility dispute and exception handling workflows with meter re-read requests, bill adjustments, dispute resolution tracking, and verification notes
- Consumption analytics and reporting with trends, peak usage, demand analysis, seasonal comparisons, conservation metrics, and usage forecasts
- Integration with tenant, lease, unit, property, and vendor data to assign utility costs accurately and reflect lease terms
- Utility cost recovery and recharge options for owner-paid utilities, service charge recovery, tenant-billed utilities, and utility allowances
- Support for utility subsidies, rebates, hardship programs, concessions, and affordability adjustments
- Tax, VAT, GST, and regulatory charge handling with jurisdiction-specific rules and configurable tax schedules
- Utility charge reversals, corrections, credits, refunds, and reconciliation with accounting and ledger systems
- Custom utility charge categories for water, electricity, waste, sewer, gas, district heating, telecom, internet, and amenity services
- Meter reading exception alerts for missing reads, stale readings, abnormal consumption spikes, reverse flow, and meter faults
- Consumption validation rules, wear-and-tear allowances, estimated reading logic, and auto-adjustments for missing or invalid readings
- Utility invoice delivery via email, SMS, tenant portal, mobile app, and print-ready PDF statements
- Role-based visibility for utility billing managers, property managers, owners, tenants, and accounting staff
- Utility credit and deposit management with refundable security deposits, prepayments, and advance consumption credits
- Multi-currency support, exchange rates, and international utility billing across jurisdictions
- API endpoints for meter reading submission, tariff retrieval, utility bill generation, and utility payment reconciliation
- Audit trail for meter reads, tariff changes, invoice edits, payment history, and utility billing adjustments
- Utility billing dashboard with overdue balances, consumption hotspots, billing exceptions, revenue by utility type, and utility performance KPIs
- Utility service provider integration, third-party billing system connectivity, and utility data import/export
- Support for utility disconnection/reconnection workflows and service status tracking based on payment status and policy rules
- Conservation and sustainability reporting for energy efficiency, water savings, waste reduction, and tenant engagement programs

