# Service Charge Management

Support:

- Service charge budget planning with recurring budgets, expense forecasting, budget approval workflows, and budget revision history
- Allocation rules by unit, building, property, tenant type, meter reading, occupancy ratio, or fixed share
- Collections management for service charge invoicing, payment tracking, aging reports, dunning notices, and arrears monitoring
- Expense reconciliation between service charge receipts, actual spending, third-party invoices, and provider payments
- Service charge statements, account summaries, notice letters, and statement distribution with tenant-specific reporting and archival
