- Waivers, abatements, subsidies, discounts, and hardship adjustments for service charge accounts
- Multicurrency support, tax treatment, and regulatory surcharge handling for service charge billing
- Tenant-specific service charge profiles, billing cycles, and bill pooling for shared services
- Automated statement generation, approval workflows, and delivery via email, SMS, and tenant/mobile notification channels
- Dispute handling workflows for contested service charges, adjustment approvals, and audit trails
- Service provider cost capture with integration to vendor invoices, purchase orders, and maintenance work orders
- Allocation of administrative fees, management fees, and reserve contributions alongside service charge billing
- Role-based visibility for property managers, owners, HOA boards, and tenant representatives
- Historical service charge analytics, consumption trends, and portfolio-level reporting

