# Maintenance & Repairs Module

## Maintenance Requests

Support:

- Request creation through tenant portals, mobile apps, web forms, email, phone, kiosks, and USSD
- Request categorization, service type, issue type, and priority levels
- Property, building, floor, unit, asset, and lease assignment
- Request status tracking with timestamps for request raised, accepted, scheduled, in progress, and closed
- Photo, document, audio, and video attachments for issue evidence and condition capture
- Request metadata such as impact severity, estimated cost, requested completion date, and tenant urgency
- Automated request triage and categorization using templates, rules, and intelligent suggestions
- Emergency and safety request flags with dedicated response workflows
- Tenant self-service issue reporting with guided fault submission and location mapping
- Request recurrence settings for repeat maintenance and planned preventative work

## Workflow and Assignment

Support:

- Technician assignment, vendor assignment, and subcontractor dispatch
- SLA definitions, service windows, response time targets, and completion time targets
- Work order generation, scheduling, task lists, and mobile technician job cards
- Statuses: New, Assigned, In Progress, On Hold, Scheduled, Resolved, Completed, Closed, Reopened
- Predictive scheduling with resource availability, skill matching, and geographic optimization
- Maintenance route planning, calendar integration, and dispatch coordination
- Work order dependencies, prerequisites, and approval gating
- Work order cost estimation, parts/materials tracking, labor hours, and time logging
- Asset and equipment linkage for preventive maintenance, warranties, and lifecycle management
- Maintenance checklists, inspection forms, and compliance requirements per request
- Automated reassignment and escalation for SLA breaches and overdue tasks
- Contractor onboarding and managed vendor pools for outsourced maintenance

## Communication

Support:

- Request comments, internal notes, and stakeholder collaboration threads
- Status notifications and alerts for tenants, owners, technicians, vendors, and managers
- Customer feedback, ratings, and satisfaction surveys after completion
- Tenant-facing updates through mobile app, SMS, email, and in-app feed
- Technician notifications for new assignments, schedule changes, and parts requests
- Maintenance escalation alerts for missed SLAs, safety incidents, and emergency responses
- Service completion confirmations, warranty notifications, and maintenance follow-ups
- Communication audit trails and notification logs for compliance and quality control
- Knowledge base and FAQs for common maintenance issues and self-help troubleshooting

