# Vendor Management

Support:

- Vendor profiles with company details, contact persons, service specialties, certifications, insurance, banking information, vendor tier, and approval status
- Vendor onboarding workflows including registration, KYC, document verification, approval gates, and compliance checks
- Contract lifecycle management with contract creation, renewals, amendments, milestones, termination, SLA definitions, pricing terms, and attached documents
- Service catalog and categories for vendor skills, service types, preferred vendors, geographic service areas, and specializations
- Performance tracking with SLA compliance, response times, work order completion rates, quality scores, tenant feedback, vendor scorecards, and issue resolution metrics
- Payment terms management covering invoice submission, approval routing, scheduled payments, retainers, partial payments, holdbacks, dispute resolution, and payment history
- Vendor assignment to maintenance requests, work orders, purchase orders, emergency callouts, and scheduled services
