- Region and jurisdiction support including local tax configurations, currency management, and service-area compliance
- Vendor self-service portal capabilities for invoice upload, service status updates, contract access, and payment notifications
- Integration pathways for procurement, maintenance management, accounting, payment gateways, and third-party vendor platforms
- Vendor dispute and claims workflows with escalation paths, resolution tracking, and audit trails
- Vendor SLA breach detection, automated alerts, corrective action tracking, and compliance metrics

