# Visitor Management

Support:

- Visitor registration with guest details, purpose of visit, expected arrival, vehicle information, and special instructions
- Visitor pre-registration and invitation management for tenant, owner, staff, and visitor self-service workflows
- Visitor badge generation with printable badge templates, QR codes, NFC entry passes, time-limited access, and custom branding
- Host assignment linking visitors to unit, tenant, owner, property manager, or department hosts
- Visit scheduling, appointment booking, approval workflows, and automated reminders for hosts and visitors
- Access control with entry authorization, guard approval, checkpoint validation, access levels, and restricted area designation
- Visit history and audit trail with check-in/check-out timestamps, badge issuance, access points, escort requirements, and visitor notes
- Visitor pre-approval workflows for security checks, watchlist screening, and blacklist/whitelist management
- Visitor check-in and check-out using mobile apps, kiosks, guard terminals, QR codes, and manual reception entry
- Real-time visitor status tracking, dashboard visibility, and watchlist alerts for unauthorized or restricted visitors
- Visitor document capture for ID verification, photograph capture, vehicle registration, and visit purpose documentation
- Temporary access passes for vendors, contractors, delivery personnel, and event attendees
- Parking allocation and visitor vehicle management with parking permit issuance and lane/lot tracking
- Access expiration and automatic badge deactivation for one-time, recurring, or scheduled visits
- Host notification and visitor arrival alerts by email, SMS, push notification, or in-app message
- Visitor mobility and escort requirement flags for secure facilities and high-risk zones
- Visitor compliance tracking for property rules, COVID/safety declarations, privacy notices, and liability agreements
- Visitor metrics and reporting on guest volume, peak arrival times, host responsiveness, and access control effectiveness
- Integration with property access systems, gate controls, alarm systems, and security cameras
- Role-based visitor management access for security teams, receptionists, property managers, and compliance officers
- Visitor feedback and satisfaction tracking for hospitality and community experience
- Emergency evacuation and muster list support for visitor tracking during drills and incidents
- Visitor data retention policies, privacy controls, and secure archival for compliance review

