# Documents Management

Support:

- Upload and store property documents, lease agreements, invoices, receipts, maintenance reports, insurance certificates, compliance certificates, permits, warranties, inspection reports, contracts, and legal documents
- Document categorization and metadata tagging for document type, property, unit, tenant, vendor, lease, expiry date, review status, and compliance classification
- Version control and document history with change tracking, version compare, rollback, and approval workflows
- Secure access and sharing with role-based document permissions, link-based sharing, password-protected downloads, and audit logging of document views and downloads
- Document expiry alerts, renewal reminders, certificate expiry notifications, and automated owner/manager notifications
- Document search, filtering, faceted navigation, and full-text search across document contents and metadata
- Document workflow automation for review, approval, signature collection, renewal, and archival
- Support for file types such as PDF, DOCX, XLSX, CSV, images, video, audio, and compressed archives
- Document annotation, comments, and collaboration notes for supervision, maintenance, legal, and tenant review
- Document retention and disposal policies with configurable retention schedules, legal hold, and secure purge workflows
- Tenant document access portals with contextual document delivery for lease documents, invoices, statements, notices, and compliance records
- Secure electronic signature integration and tracking for leases, consents, approvals, and vendor contracts
- Document lock/unlock controls, check-in/check-out workflows, and concurrent access management
- Compliance document repositories for audit documentation, insurance proof, regulatory filings, and safety certifications
- Document import/export capabilities for bulk upload, archive export, and migration support
- Intelligent document classification and OCR support for scanned documents and image-based attachments
- Encrypted document storage with separate access controls for confidential, financial, legal, and personal information
- Document change notification feeds for stakeholders when critical documents are updated or replaced
- Support document templates for leases, contracts, notices, certificates, and standard letters

