# Notification Engine

## Channels

Support:

- Email
- SMS
- Push notifications
- In-app notifications
- Webhooks
- USSD notifications
- Voice calls / IVR notifications
- WhatsApp and messaging integrations

## Delivery Features

Support:

- Multi-channel routing with fallback logic
- Channel preference management per user and tenant
- Localized notifications in user preferred language
- Scheduled delivery windows and quiet hours
- Retry policies, dead-letter handling, and failure notifications
- Throttling, rate limiting, and provider failover
- Template versioning and audit-ready history
- Notification batching for grouped reminders and digests
- Custom branding per tenant, property, or business unit

## Notification Types

Support:

- Payment reminders
- Invoice delivery
- Transaction history emails
- Lease renewal alerts
- Maintenance updates
- Document expirations
- Visitor alerts
- Role-based announcements
- System alerts
- Account activation and onboarding notifications
- Password reset and security alerts
- Approval reminders and escalation alerts
- Billing adjustment and refund notifications
- Lease amendment and renewal confirmations
- Service outage and disruption notifications
- Vendor assignment and work order alerts
- Compliance and audit reminders

## Templates & Personalization

Support:

- Rich text templates with dynamic placeholders
- Multi-language template management
- Tenant-specific templates for branding and tone
- Personalization using tenant, property, unit, lease, and user data
- Conditional content blocks and smart templates
- Template preview, test send, and approval workflows
- Templates for email, SMS, push, USSD, and webhook payloads

## Triggering & Automation

Support:

- Event-driven notifications from leases, payments, maintenance, visitors, documents, and audit events
- Workflow-driven notifications for approvals, escalations, exceptions, and renewals
- Scheduled and recurring notifications for periodic reminders and reports
- Custom rule builder for event, time, and threshold conditions
- Notification workflows with branching, approvals, and conditional actions
- Webhook event publishing for external systems and integrations

## User Preferences & Compliance

Support:

- Opt-in/opt-out preferences per channel and notification category
