- Communication preference capture for tenants, owners, vendors, and staff
- Consent tracking and opt-in history for audit and privacy compliance
- Unsubscribe management for email and SMS channels
- Privacy-safe delivery with masked data in SMS and push notifications

## Monitoring & Analytics

Support:

- Delivery success, failure, open, click, and bounce metrics
- Channel performance dashboards and trending reports
- Notification audit logs with send time, channel, status, and content snapshot
- Failed notification alerting and retry reporting
- Usage metrics by tenant, property, role, and channel
- Notification heatmaps for engagement and response analysis

## Integrations

Support:

- External SMS and email provider integrations
- Push notification services for Android and iOS
- Webhook callbacks for external workflow systems
- USSD gateway connectivity for non-smartphone user outreach
- SMS/USSD two-way messaging for confirmations and responses
