- Scheduled report distribution via email, mobile push, and portal notifications
- Real-time analytics with drill-down capabilities, ad hoc querying, and interactive visualizations
- Cross-property benchmarking and performance comparison between assets, property types, and regions
- User-defined dashboards for owners, property managers, accountants, maintenance, and support teams
- Audit-ready reports with timestamped exports, report versioning, and data lineage metadata
- Integration with BI tools, data warehouses, and external analytics platforms via APIs and data exports
- Data visualization support for charts, tables, maps, trend lines, cohorts, and pivot analysis
- KPI alerts and threshold monitoring for occupancy drops, overdue collections, maintenance backlogs, and compliance deviations
- Category-based dashboard analytics for residential and commercial portfolios

