# Audit & Compliance

Support:

- Audit logs for system events, financial transactions, tenant payments, user actions, administrative changes, permission updates, and configuration deployments
- Activity tracking for users, tenants, owners, managers, support staff, vendors, and external integrations with session context and workflow state
- Change history for property, unit, lease, invoice, payment, maintenance request, ticket, vendor contract, and approval record updates
- Access logs detailing authentication events, API calls, failed logins, session duration, privilege elevation, IP address, device fingerprint, and geographic source
- Compliance reporting for regulatory, tax, KYC, AML, data privacy, audit readiness, and industry-specific housing regulations
- Data retention policies with configurable retention schedules, archiving, secure deletion, legal hold support, and retention exception workflows
- Immutable, tamper-evident audit trails for critical workflows, financial approvals, lease signatures, and dispute resolution
- Role-based access to audit and compliance reports, with tenant-level, property-level, and system-level visibility controls
- Exportable audit reports to CSV, Excel, PDF, JSON, and compliance-specific formats for auditors and regulators
- Compliance dashboards for data privacy, financial controls, SLA adherence, occupancy compliance, and risk posture monitoring
- Automated alerts and workflows for policy violations, unauthorized access, suspicious activity, expired certifications, and compliance drift
- Scheduled audit reviews, exception tracking, investigation notes, and escalation workflows for remediation
- Audit certification mapping and support for ISO 27001, PCI-DSS, SOC 2, GDPR, local tax, housing, and property management standards
- Secure storage with encryption-at-rest and encryption-in-transit for archived audit records, compliance documents, and evidence artifacts
- Audit trail search, filtering, retention filtering, and forensic investigation tools for rapid incident response
- Versioned document and contract audits with old/new comparison, change annotation, and approval history
- Data subject access request support, privacy consent tracking, and right-to-be-forgotten workflows
- Regulatory and geo-fencing controls for data residency, sovereignty, and jurisdiction-specific record handling
- Periodic compliance assessment reports, audit readiness checks, and evidence packaging for external auditors
- Audit log retention management with automatic purge, archival workflows, and compliance-safe deletion controls

