# User & Role Management

## User Management

Support:

- User creation with tenant, property, role, and contact assignment
- User import/export via CSV, Excel, JSON, and bulk onboarding workflows
- User activation/deactivation, account locking, suspension, and soft deletion
- Profile management for personal, contact, employment, identity, and access details
- Multi-factor authentication with OTP, email, SMS, authenticator apps, biometrics, and device trust
- Tenant self-registration support with guided signup, KYC capture, identity verification, and approval workflows
- Property owner tenant onboarding support with owner-managed invitations, tenant assignment, and lease initiation
- Passwordless login, password reset, and secure account recovery workflows
- Single sign-on (SSO) integration via OAuth2, OpenID Connect, SAML, and enterprise identity providers
- User session and device management with session history, active session revocation, and login notifications
- Role-based access assignment, user groups, team membership, and delegated administration
- User status dashboards with onboarding progress, access approvals, and compliance checkpoints
- User audit logs for login activity, profile changes, role changes, and permission updates
- External identity provider support for social, corporate, and partner authentication
- User consent management, privacy preferences, and communication preferences
- Tenant and owner user directory with search, filters, and hierarchical property/portfolio views
- User impersonation support for administrators with audit trail and restricted scope
- Notifications for account activation, approval, password changes, and security alerts
- Temporary user accounts for contractors, vendors, and seasonal staff
- Support for emergency access roles and break-glass procedures

## Role Management

Support:

- Create roles with descriptive names, ownership, and tenant/property scope
- Assign permissions to roles using granular action sets and functional categories
- Clone roles to quickly replicate existing role definitions and modify them
- Edit roles with change tracking, version history, and approval workflows
- Disable roles temporarily without deleting role definitions or audit history
- Archive and restore roles for audit compliance, role hygiene, and lifecycle management
- Tenant-specific roles that can be scoped to a single tenant, property, portfolio, or business unit
- Owner tenant onboarding permissions for selective role assignment during tenant onboarding and guest access
- Tenant self-service permission sets for controlled tenant portal access to profile, payments, service requests, documents, and communications
- Default system roles for super admin, property manager, owner, tenant, vendor, maintenance staff, reception/security, and support agent
- Custom role types for marketing, accounting, facility management, HOA board, investor, and partner access
- Permission assignments via role groups, role bundles, and dynamic role templates
- Role hierarchy and inheritance to manage senior/junior roles, escalation chains, and segregated duties
- Role expiration, temporary access, and time-based access windows for contractors and temporary staff
- Role change request workflows with approval, review, and audit logging
- Role simulation and access preview for administrators before applying permission changes
- Role-based dashboards and navigation tailored by user type, tenant, property, and region
- Policy enforcement for critical security roles, separation of duties, and dual approval for sensitive operations
- Support for role-based MFA, access approval, and privileged access management
- Role audit logs to track who created, modified, enabled, disabled, or archived roles and when

## Permission Categories

Support:

- Property management
- Unit management
- Lease management
- Financial management
- Maintenance management
- Reporting
- Administration
- Notification management
- Tenant self-service
- Vendor and supplier access
- Visitor access control
- Utility and billing management
- Audit and compliance access
- Document management
- Support and ticketing
- Mobile and USSD user access
- System configuration and integrations

Permissions should be:

- Assignable at tenant, property, building, unit, and portfolio scope
- Configurable per role, per user, and per functional area
- Grantable as granular actions (Create, Read, Update, Delete, Approve, Export, Publish, Archive, Manage)
- Support hierarchical role inheritance and permission overrides
- Include separation of duties and dual-approval workflows for critical operations
- Enforce session limits, access windows, and time-based restrictions for sensitive functions
- Support audit-friendly permission changes with review history and approval logs
- Enable custom permission groups and composite permission bundles for fast role building
- Allow tenant-specific custom permission labels and business rule mapping

