- AI rental price prediction and dynamic rent recommendations
- AI maintenance cost forecasting and preventative alerts
- Smart occupancy analytics and asset utilization forecasting
- IoT integrations for smart meters, sensors, energy, and environmental monitoring
- Smart locks and electronic access control integration
- Electronic lease signing and contract automation
- Community marketplace and resident social network
- Insurance integration and claims tracking
- Loan and mortgage product integration for property financing
- Partner marketplace for service providers, suppliers, and professional services
- Tenant loyalty, rewards, and engagement programs
- Investor portal and asset performance modelling
- Blockchain-ready audit trail and smart contract support for advanced use cases

---

# Summary

WAKA PMS should be a fully integrated platform that supports property operations from registration through leasing, billing, maintenance, and reporting. The architecture must be secure, tenant-aware, highly configurable, and built for web and mobile users across small landlords, property management companies, and enterprise estate operations.
